## Validation Notes

- Focused AI SDK example typechecks pass:
  - `bun run --filter ai-sdk-tool-registry-agent-example typecheck`
  - `bun run --filter ai-sdk-local-exec-agent-example typecheck`
- AI SDK example fixture tests pass: `bun test examples/ai-sdk-tool-registry-agent/test/e2e.test.ts examples/ai-sdk-local-exec-agent/test/e2e.test.ts`.
- Full examples typecheck passes: `bun run typecheck:examples`.
- Direct AI SDK examples are intentionally not Flue agents and contain no `@flue/*`, `agents/`, `flue run`, or `session.prompt` usage.
- The examples load `.env` from their current working directory and support `HARBOR_LOCAL_PROJECT_ROOT`/`HARBOR_PROJECT_ROOT` to reuse a previously authenticated `.harbor` store.
